    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever dreamt of time travel? Imagine if time machines existed, hidden as ordinary objects like, say, teapots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this choice-based visual novel, you're handed a time-travelling  teapot and tasked with recovering the entire tea set. Of course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your world isn't what it seems. That dull, sleepy town you call home  is about to flip upside down. Witches with time machines indeed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through past, present, and future. Encounter a wild cast of  characters: daring pirates, mythical Assyrian monsters, and futuristic  androids. Track down the elusive Uncle Hector and uncover his  astonishing secret. Ready for the adventure of a lifetime?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strand Games, pioneers of next-gen audio-visual interactive fiction, invites you on an unforgettable adventure!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Fantastic 4K Digital Artwork</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Atmospheric visuals and sound</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Choice Based branching Storylines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Character Dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Clickable Text and Graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a02 Hours of Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Over 170 beautiful pictures</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever dreamt of time travel? Imagine if time machines existed, hidden as ordinary objects like, say, teapots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this choice-based visual novel, you're handed a time-travelling  teapot and tasked with recovering the entire tea set. Of course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your world isn't what it seems. That dull, sleepy town you call home  is about to flip upside down. Witches with time machines indeed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through past, present, and future. Encounter a wild cast of  characters: daring pirates, mythical Assyrian monsters, and futuristic  androids. Track down the elusive Uncle Hector and uncover his  astonishing secret. Ready for the adventure of a lifetime?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strand Games, pioneers of next-gen audio-visual interactive fiction, invites you on an unforgettable adventure!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Fantastic 4K Digital Artwork</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Atmospheric visuals and sound</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Choice Based branching Storylines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Character Dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Clickable Text and Graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a02 Hours of Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Over 170 beautiful pictures</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
